       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COBEX05.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-I             PIC 99 VALUE 1.
       01 WS-RES           PIC 99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.

           PERFORM CALCULATE-TABLE UNTIL WS-I > 10.

           STOP RUN.

       CALCULATE-TABLE.

